557 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Agricultural Region Planning Information System, hereinafter abbreviated as SIKP, is a page that contains information about tabular and spatial data on agricultural areas. SIKP contains data and information collected from the database in the e-Proposal application.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
558 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The development of SIKP is a form of follow-up from the Minister of Agriculture Regulation No. 41 / Permentan / OT.140 / 3/2014 concerning Guidelines for Agricultural Development Planning Based on e-Planning. SIKP displays spatial data and tabular data on agricultural areas managed in the form of websites. Tabular data is presented in the form of a statistical table that displays the results of the comparison between existing data and potential data.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
559 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (SIKP contains data and information collected from the database in the e-proposal application. The e-proposal is a web-based annual planning information system that is intended to facilitate the proposal of programs, activities, and the state budget of the Ministry of Agriculture of all Regional Work Units that carry out agricultural affairs in the provinces / districts / cities and Work Units within the Ministry of Agriculture in the Center and Region.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
560 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The SIKP design is structured in such a way that it runs interactively with the e-Proposal application. SIKP and e-Proposal are part of e-Planning. SIKP is dynamic and always updated data referring to the data base in e-Proposal which is updated annually. The data base in e-Proposal will be transferred into the SIKP and then the tabular and spatial data contained in the SIKP will be used as material to be analyzed and the plans will be proposed in the e-Proposal.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
